\section[orientation=landscape]

=* Appendix A: Error Mapping {#app:errors}

\table[header-rows=1, widths=(5cm, 1.6cm, 1fr, 1fr, 2cm, 1fr), columns=(left, center, left, left, center, left)]{
  | Gateway code       | HTTP | Meaning                 | Adapter action       | Retry | Logged as        |
  | `card_declined`    | 402  | Issuer declined         | Show decline message | No    | `payment.declined` |
  | `rate_limited`     | 429  | Too many requests       | Back off             | Yes   | `gateway.throttled` |
  | `processing_error` | 500  | Gateway internal error  | Retry with same key  | Yes   | `gateway.error`  |
}

